# The top circle of a drafted post in loft_sides.tlspr lofted to the
# tip, picked with the mouse, set on its screen to leave along the
# post's sides; the same as path_loft_sides.go makes
# (TestPathEquivalence/loft_sides).
file $testdata/ui/loft_sides.tlspr
menu File|Open...
view default
move 300 250
down L 300 250
up L 300 250
menu Features|Loft To Selected Profile
twmove 320 185
twdown L 320 185
twup L 320 185
